        "date": "2026-11-12T13:41:21Z"
      },
      "message": "test(pocket3d_hsm): the bore's Linux triple, measured with #1050 and #1169\n\nLinux x86-64 rode the band of the Windows and macOS triples; the\nplanner changes of #1050 and #1169 move the plan out of it (15561 /\n14837 / 1561, two release runs identical; every level verifies clean,\nnone falls back). Added as its own exact arm. The Windows and macOS\ntriples predate the change and are owed a re-measure there; they are\nleft as measured.\n\nRefs #1050\nRefs #1169\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
